{"title":"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A straight concrete sidewalk is to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> feet wide, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet long, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> <b>inches</b> thick.  How many cubic yards of concrete must a contractor order for the sidewalk if concrete must be ordered in a whole number of cubic yards?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/e/aae383b66aa667cec0dcfa95a0eeb7ffd2f0b83d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{more than 20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"439\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sidewalk is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> yard wide, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> yards long, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e10f7b229549d9afbdef6ae2862bc89bacfe16cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> yard thick, so its volume is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/b/eab0ad605f728f4efaa12da437929c1839b4f122.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\cdot 20\\cdot\\frac{1}{12} = 1\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"124\" height=\"38\" /> cubic yards.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/6/396b58055c2c1b0ce6cac97fa956fd300ff4307b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> cubic yards must be ordered.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME\" title=\"1990 AJHSME\">1990 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a h